# ============================================================================
# AI Data Chat — model provider configuration (server-side only).
# Copy to `.env.local`. API keys are NEVER exposed to the browser; all model
# calls run in the /api/chat route. With no config the deterministic MOCK
# provider is used (offline, no key required) — great for development.
# ============================================================================

# Provider: mock (default) | anthropic | openai | google
# - mock:      offline, deterministic. Classifies the question, calls the same
#              controlled tools a real LLM would, and composes from real data.
# - anthropic: real adapter. The tools + deterministic builders still produce
#              ALL numbers/blocks/sources; the model only rewrites the prose.
# - openai/google: interface-ready; no verified adapter shipped (factory throws).
CHAT_AI_PROVIDER=mock

# Optional model id override (provider-specific default is used if unset).
# CHAT_AI_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-5

# Provider API keys (only the one matching CHAT_AI_PROVIDER is read).
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# GOOGLE_GENERATIVE_AI_API_KEY=

# ============================================================================
# Supabase — scientific persistence (project "mlb-edge").
# With NONE of these set the app uses in-memory persistence (tests / keyless dev).
# The public URL + anon key are browser-safe; the service-role key is SERVER-ONLY
# and must never be committed or exposed to a client bundle.
# ============================================================================
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<anon-or-publishable-key>
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=<service-role-key>   # server only — trusted writes

# ============================================================================
# Tennis live data providers (server-side only — NEVER expose to the browser).
# With NONE of these set, every live Tennis provider is inert by design
# ("unconfigured"); the app shows honest empty/degraded states and never
# substitutes fixtures for live data. A key alone does NOT make a provider
# "ready" — readiness requires a verified live call (auth + schema + mapping +
# independent verification). See docs/tennis/PROVIDERS.md.
# ============================================================================
# Sportradar Tennis v3 — api_key query param. Commercial license (trial/prod).
# SPORTRADAR_TENNIS_API_KEY=
# SportsDataIO Tennis — Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key header. Commercial license.
# SPORTSDATAIO_TENNIS_API_KEY=
# API-Tennis (api-tennis.com) — APIkey query param. Freemium, rate-limited.
# API_TENNIS_API_KEY=
